---
import Plate from './Plate.astro';
---
<Plate caption="One cutter, three times. You are filing a knife edge with a working corner — and the depth gauge in front of it decides how big a bite that corner takes.">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 440 300" class="dwg" role="img" aria-labelledby="tp-t tp-d">
    <title id="tp-t">A chain cutter filed correctly, with too much hook, and with a back slope</title>
    <desc id="tp-d">
      Three cutters in side view. The first is filed correctly: the top plate slopes back
      at roughly thirty degrees, the working corner is sharp, and the depth gauge in front
      of it is set a fixed distance below the top plate. The second has too much hook — the
      cutting edge is undercut, so it grabs and chatters. The third has a back slope: the
      edge leans away from the wood, so it will not cut and the saw smokes and pushes.
    </desc>

    <!-- correct -->
    <g transform="translate(16 30)">
      <text x="0" y="-10">Right</text>
      <path class="metal" d="M0 60h120v18H0z" />
      <path class="metal" d="M56 60c0-26 8-40 34-44l20 8c-14 10-20 22-20 36z" />
      <path class="ink" d="M90 24l20 8-8 4-18-6z" />
      <path class="metal" d="M14 40h20l4 20H14z" />
      <path class="rule" d="M14 36h30" />
      <path class="cut" d="M34 32h28M34 26v12M62 26v12" />
      <text x="0" y="20" class="quiet">depth gauge</text>
      <text x="70" y="104" class="quiet">working corner</text>
      <path class="rule" d="M98 34 90 90" />
    </g>

    <!-- too much hook -->
    <g transform="translate(160 30)">
      <text x="0" y="-10">Too much hook</text>
      <path class="metal" d="M0 60h120v18H0z" />
      <path class="metal" d="M56 60c0-26 8-40 34-44l20 8c-20 6-24 20-20 36z" />
      <path class="danger" d="M86 20c-14 14-14 26-8 36" />
      <text x="0" y="112" class="quiet">grabs, chatters, snaps the corner off</text>
    </g>

    <!-- back slope -->
    <g transform="translate(304 30)">
      <text x="0" y="-10">Back slope</text>
      <path class="metal" d="M0 60h120v18H0z" />
      <path class="metal" d="M56 60c0-26 8-40 34-44l16 14c-16 4-24 16-20 30z" />
      <path class="danger" d="M92 22l14 12" />
      <text x="0" y="112" class="quiet">will not cut — dust, smoke, and you pushing</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
</Plate>
